            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2154] Not work in the web dev mode if changing default port</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2154</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If user change port variable (zeppelin.server.port), zeppelin doesn&apos;t work in web development. Thus currently user should change from custom port to default port (8080). It would be nice to fix because It&apos;s quite inconvenient.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
